values ('c4d5e6f7-8a9b-4c19-8d18-2e3f4a5b6c09', 'human-resource-management-in-hospitality', 'Human Resource Management in Hospitality', 'This course equips future hospitality managers to design and operate fair, lawful, inclusive, safe, and high-performing employment systems. Students forecast labor, analyze and design jobs, recruit and select talent, onboard and develop employees, create engagement and voice, manage performance, design rewards and schedules, administer employee and labor relations, protect safety and well-being, strengthen retention and succession, and use HR technology and people analytics responsibly. Applied cases culminate in an integrated people strategy and HR policy implementation plan.');

